Description: GTFShift emerged from the necessity to perform systematic
    analysis for academic research over General Transit Feed Specification
    (GTFS) files that were not supported by any R library. It compiles the
    methods developed for this purpose, aiming to contribute to an open
    source culture.  Its functionality is built mostly on
    [tidytransit](https://r-transit.github.io/tidytransit/) package.
License: GPL
URL: https://github.com/U-Shift/GTFShift,
    https://u-shift.github.io/GTFShift/
